Id: snmp001w
Severity: WARN
Category: services
Check: check_snmp
References: snmpd.conf(5)
Controls: CIS 4.8, 5.2; NIST IA-5(7), SC-7; ISO 5.17, 8.20; CE User access control

SNMP answers a write community from the whole network. Its extend
and exec hooks run commands for whoever asks: that is remote
control of the box. Take the community out, or narrow it to the
manager's address.
